---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Tail at scale: chance that a page is slow when each server is slow on 1 request in 100.
// Values come from the Go program shown in the post (1 - 0.99^k).
const W = 900;
const H = 372;
const bars = [
  { en: '1 server per page', vi: '1 server mỗi trang', pct: 1.0, label: '1.0%' },
  { en: '10 servers per page', vi: '10 server mỗi trang', pct: 9.6, label: '9.6%' },
  { en: '100 servers per page', vi: '100 server mỗi trang', pct: 63.4, label: '63.4%' },
];
const x0 = 250;
const track = 580;
---
<figure class="gp15a">
  <div class="gp15a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Bar chart: if each server is slow on 1 request in 100, a page that waits for 1 server is slow 1.0% of the time, for 10 servers 9.6%, for 100 servers 63.4%. Below: more pods add capacity but leave the slow 1 in 100 unchanged.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Share of pages that are slow, when each server is slow on 1 request in 100</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tỉ lệ trang bị chậm, khi mỗi server chậm 1 request trong 100</tspan>
    </text>
    {bars.map((b, i) => (
      <g>
        <DiagramIcon name="server" x={34} y={59 + i * 44} size={26} />
        <text x="58" y={64 + i * 44} class="b">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{b.en}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{b.vi}</tspan>
        </text>
        <rect x={x0} y={46 + i * 44} width={track} height="26" rx="4" class="track" />
        <rect x={x0} y={46 + i * 44} width={Math.max(4, (track * b.pct) / 100)} height="26" rx="4" class={i === 2 ? 'hot fm-pulse' : 'fill'} />
        <text x={x0 + Math.max(4, (track * b.pct) / 100) + 10} y={64 + i * 44} class={i === 2 ? 'r num' : 'b num'}>{b.label}</text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="190" y2="190" class="rule" />
    <text x="20" y="218" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>What adding pods changes, and what it does not</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thêm pod thay đổi gì, và không thay đổi gì</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="236" width="420" height="116" rx="8" class="goldbox" />
    <DiagramIcon name="speedup" x={48} y={257} size={26} />
    <text x="72" y="262" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Capacity: it helps</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Công suất: có giúp</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="288" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Each pod gets fewer requests, so queues</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi pod nhận ít request hơn, nên hàng đợi</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="310" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>get shorter and the service handles more</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ngắn đi và service chịu được nhiều tải hơn</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="332" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>traffic in total.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tính tổng thể.</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="460" y="236" width="420" height="116" rx="8" class="hot" />
    <DiagramIcon name="slow" x={488} y={257} size={26} />
    <text x="512" y="262" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Tail latency: it does not</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Độ trễ đuôi: không giúp</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="288" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The same code on a new pod is still slow on</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một đoạn code trên pod mới vẫn chậm</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="310" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1 request in 100. A page that needs 100 of</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1 request trong 100. Một trang cần 100 request</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="332" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>them still hits a slow one 63.4% of the time.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>như vậy vẫn gặp một request chậm 63,4% số lần.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The 1% slow rate is the assumption used in The Tail at Scale; the percentages are 1 − 0.99<sup>k</sup>, computed by the program above.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mức chậm 1% là giả định trong bài The Tail at Scale; các phần trăm là 1 − 0,99<sup>k</sup>, do chương trình ở trên tính ra.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp15a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp15a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp15a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp15a text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp15a .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp15a .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp15a .body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp15a .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gp15a .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp15a .track { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp15a .fill { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp15a .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp15a .goldbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp15a .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp15a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
